# General principles

Follow [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) guardrails. Prefer small, focused changes; match existing patterns in the package you edit.

- DRY, SOLID, explicit naming
- Validate inputs at boundaries; never log secrets
- Run `yarn build` / `yarn test-packages` after substantive edits

